  "wan": {
    "class_type": "Wan3ReferenceToVideoApi",
    "inputs": {
      "model": "wan3.0-video",
      "model.prompt": "In Video 1, replace 2 subjects and leave everyone and everything else exactly as filmed. Video 2 is the same footage as Video 1 from 0.0 s to 6.7 s, with each subject to replace filled in one flat colour that stays on them throughout. It only shows who is who: the result has no flat colours, and nobody's face, hair or clothes come from Video 2. Person 1, filled in red in Video 2, becomes Cal, shown in Image 1 and Image 2: A man in his late sixties with swept-back silver hair, in a charcoal wool overcoat, navy sweater, dark trousers and black shoes. Take the face only from the close portrait in Image 1. Image 2 is a character sheet: body, build, hair from behind and clothing; the heads are left out of the full-body panels on purpose. Person 2, filled in blue in Video 2, becomes Cal, shown in Image 3 and Image 4: A man in his late sixties with swept-back silver hair, in a charcoal wool overcoat, navy sweater, dark trousers and black shoes. Take the face only from the close portrait in Image 3. Image 4 is a character sheet: body, build, hair from behind and clothing; the heads are left out of the full-body panels on purpose. Keep the place, the light and everyone else exactly as in Video 1. Each new person copies every step, gesture and expression of the person they replace, with the same timing, the same camera framing and the same camera movement as Video 1. Photorealistic.",
